      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GUY'S LAST PRIZE (1) has gone to a new level this prep where he remains undefeated in two starts. Slow into stride when he jumped in trip for a last to first win over 1660m at Moruya. Can carry the extra weight and prove hard to hold out. SUNROE (6) on the quick backup after she motored late in the heavy going to secure fourth over this trip at Wagga a week ago. Adept in all conditions and finds an easier contest. JUST LIKE LIAM (2) pacifiers come off and visors go on for this after he sat on the pace for a courageous win over 1600m at this track. The map looks a lot better today and hard to knock winning form. TSARINA DIAMONDS (8) was too good for an average Maiden field last start when she gripped on to score over 1400m at Narrandera. Placed at this trip and Ly's 2kg claim keeps her in the mix.",
